title: Fundraising
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 12

= Fundraising

The Federation cannot compete with the Conservative Republicans' money. We depend on membership dues, which come in at the start of each year.

Current dues yield [+ dues +] resources per year.

- @maintain: Keep dues where they are.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
on-arrival: month_actions += 1

We keep our dues as they are.

@reduce
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; month_actions += 1; socialists_dissent -= 3; populists_dissent -= 3; unionists_dissent -= 3; progressives_dissent -= 3

Our members appreciate the break, though the party's treasury will feel it.

@increase
choose-if: dues < 6
on-arrival: dues += 1; month_actions += 1; socialists_dissent += 3; populists_dissent += 3; unionists_dissent += 3; progressives_dissent += 3

Our members grumble, and some of the less committed drift away. But there will be more to spend in future.
